-- recpdcl-executive-recruitment-32-posts-20261116 (English 855 words; Nepali 526 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'recpdcl-executive-recruitment-32-posts-20261116', 'asia', 'India',
'RECPDCL Executive Recruitment 2026: 32 Posts, Apply by 17 November',
'RECPDCL कार्यकारी भर्ती २०२६: ३२ पद, १७ नोभेम्बरसम्म आवेदन',
'REC Power Development and Consultancy Limited has opened 32 fixed-term Executive posts for experienced professionals. Applications close on 17 November 2026 at 6:30 PM, and only online forms at recpdcl.in count.',
'आरईसी पावर डेभलपमेन्ट एन्ड कन्सल्टेन्सी लिमिटेडले अनुभवी पेशेवरहरूका लागि ३२ निश्चित अवधिका कार्यकारी पदमा आवेदन मागेको छ। आवेदन १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ साँझ ६:३० बजेसम्म recpdcl.in मा अनलाइन दिन सकिन्छ।',
$$<p>REC Power Development and Consultancy Limited (RECPDCL) has invited applications from experienced professionals for 32 Executive posts on a fixed-term basis. The online application window runs from 27 October to 17 November 2026, and the last date to apply is 17 November at 6:30 PM. The recruitment is advertised as RECPDCL/HR/2026/03, and applications are accepted only through the official website, recpdcl.in.</p>
<h2>At a glance</h2>
<table>
<tr><td>Organisation</td><td>REC Power Development and Consultancy Limited (RECPDCL)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Advertisement</td><td>RECPDCL/HR/2026/03, dated 27 October 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td>Total posts</td><td>32 — 3 Senior Executive, 19 Deputy Executive, 10 Assistant Executive</td></tr>
<tr><td>Apply online</td><td>27 October to 17 November 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td>Last date</td><td>17 November 2026, 6:30 PM</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tenure</td><td>Fixed term of 1 year, extendable up to 4 years and 6 months</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pay per month</td><td>Rs 62,000 (Assistant Executive) to Rs 1,55,250 (Senior Executive), consolidated</td></tr>
<tr><td>Age limit</td><td>35 years (Assistant Executive), 40 years (Deputy Executive), 55 years (Senior Executive)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Application fee</td><td>Not stated in the notification</td></tr>
<tr><td>Official website</td><td>recpdcl.in</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>What the roles are</h2>
<p>RECPDCL is a wholly owned subsidiary of REC Ltd, working under the Ministry of Power, Government of India. The 32 posts are spread across four grades. At the top is Senior Executive (Tech.), Level-5, working as Lead Verifier under the Compliance Mechanism. Below that are Deputy Executive (Tech.), Level-3, posts in distribution, renewable energy, utility coordination and transmission, both electrical and civil. The Assistant Executive (Tech.), Level-2, posts are for Utility Engineers, and there is also an Assistant Executive (Finance), Level-2, post for finance work.</p>
<p>The work covers power distribution, transmission, smart metering, renewable energy and utility coordination. Postings are spread across India, including Mumbai, Gurugram and Ladakh, with several pan-India roles. The engagement is purely temporary and is not against any permanent vacancy, so it will not lead to regular employment in RECPDCL in future.</p>
<h2>Who can apply</h2>
<p>Only Indian nationals can apply. For the technical posts, candidates need a regular full-time B.E. or B.Tech in Electrical, EEE, ECE, CSE, IT or Civil Engineering, with at least 60% marks or a first division. The Finance post needs a CA, CMA or MBA in Finance, with 60% marks or an equivalent CGPA.</p>
<p>Experience is counted as on 17 November 2026. Senior Executive candidates need 13 years of relevant post-qualification experience, Deputy Executive candidates need 6 years, and Assistant Executive candidates need 3 years. The maximum age, also as on 17 November 2026, is 55 years for Senior Executive, 40 years for Deputy Executive and 35 years for Assistant Executive.</p>
<h2>How to apply</h2>
<p>Apply online only at recpdcl.in between 27 October and 17 November 2026, before 6:30 PM on the last date. Candidates should apply for only one post, and they must read the official advertisement before submitting the form. Keep your registration details and experience certificates ready, because the age and experience cut-off is the last date itself.</p>
<h2>What the notification does not say</h2>
<p>The notice prints no grand total of 32 posts. The figure of 32 is the sum of the post-wise counts — 3 Senior Executive, 19 Deputy Executive and 10 Assistant Executive — so it should be read as a calculated total. No application fee is mentioned in the notification, so no fee figure is given here. The selection process is also not stated in the sources we checked, so whether there is a written test, an interview, or both, is not confirmed. Candidates should read the detailed advertisement on recpdcl.in before applying.</p>
<p>Never pay anyone who promises you a job at RECPDCL. No agent or middleman can secure a post for you, and anyone asking for money in exchange for selection should be treated as a scam. Apply only through the official RECPDCL website.</p>
<p>Read also: <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/nlc-india-graduate-executive-trainee-143-posts-20261115">NLC India Graduate Executive Trainee recruitment 2026 — 143 posts through GATE 2025</a>.</p>
<p>Sources: RECPDCL advertisement RECPDCL/HR/2026/03, read through <a href="https://www.sarkariresult.app/recpdcl-recruitment-2026-out-apply-online-32-senior-deputy-executive-posts/">Sarkari Result</a>, <a href="https://srn247.com/jobs/recpdcl-recruitment-2026-senior-executive-deputy-executive-assistant-executive-32-posts">SRN247</a>, <a href="https://advikpost.blog/2026/10/29/recpdcl-executive-recruitment-2026/">Advik Post</a> and <a href="https://theaspirantnews.com/job/recpdcl-senior-executive-deputy-executive-and-assistant-executive-32-posts-recruitment-2026-15374">The Aspirant News</a>, and the official website <a href="https://www.recpdcl.in">recpdcl.in</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>आरईसी पावर डेभलपमेन्ट एन्ड कन्सल्टेन्सी लिमिटेड (RECPDCL) ले अनुभवी पेशेवरहरूका लागि ३२ कार्यकारी पदमा निश्चित अवधिका लागि आवेदन मागेको छ। अनलाइन आवेदन २७ अक्टोबरदेखि १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म खुला छ र अन्तिम मिति १७ नोभेम्बर साँझ ६:३० बजे हो। यो भर्ती विज्ञापन नम्बर RECPDCL/HR/2026/03 अन्तर्गत आएको हो र आवेदन आधिकारिक वेबसाइट recpdcl.in बाट मात्र दिन सकिन्छ।</p>
<h2>एक नजरमा</h2>
<table>
<tr><td>संस्था</td><td>आरईसी पावर डेभलपमेन्ट एन्ड कन्सल्टेन्सी लिमिटेड (RECPDCL)</td></tr>
<tr><td>विज्ञापन</td><td>RECPDCL/HR/2026/03, मिति २७ अक्टोबर २०२६</td></tr>
<tr><td>कुल पद</td><td>३२ — वरिष्ठ कार्यकारी ३, उप कार्यकारी १९, सहायक कार्यकारी १०</td></tr>
<tr><td>आवेदन अवधि</td><td>२७ अक्टोबरदेखि १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म</td></tr>
<tr><td>अन्तिम मिति</td><td>१७ नोभेम्बर २०२६, साँझ ६:३० बजे</td></tr>
<tr><td>अवधि</td><td>१ वर्षको निश्चित अवधि, ४ वर्ष ६ महिनासम्म बढाउन सकिने</td></tr>
<tr><td>तलब प्रतिमहिना</td><td>रू ६२,००० (सहायक कार्यकारी) देखि रू १,५५,२५० (वरिष्ठ कार्यकारी) सम्म</td></tr>
<tr><td>उमेर सीमा</td><td>३५ वर्ष (सहायक कार्यकारी), ४० वर्ष (उप कार्यकारी), ५५ वर्ष (वरिष्ठ कार्यकारी)</td></tr>
<tr><td>आवेदन शुल्क</td><td>सूचनामा उल्लेख छैन</td></tr>
<tr><td>आधिकारिक वेबसाइट</td><td>recpdcl.in</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>पदबारे</h2>
<p>RECPDCL भारत सरकारको विद्युत मन्त्रालय अन्तर्गतको आरईसी लिमिटेडको पूर्ण स्वामित्वको सहायक कम्पनी हो। ३२ पद चार तहमा बाँडिएका छन्। सबैभन्दा माथि वरिष्ठ कार्यकारी (प्राविधिक), लेभल-५ छन्, जसले कम्प्लायन्स मेकानिज्म अन्तर्गत लिड भेरिफायरको काम गर्छन्। त्यसपछि उप कार्यकारी (प्राविधिक), लेभल-३ का पदहरू वितरण, नवीकरणीय ऊर्जा, युटिलिटी समन्वय र प्रसारण (विद्युतीय र सिभिल) क्षेत्रमा छन्। सहायक कार्यकारी (प्राविधिक), लेभल-२ का पद युटिलिटी इन्जिनियरका लागि हुन् र सहायक कार्यकारी (वित्त), लेभल-२ को पद वित्त कार्यका लागि हो।</p>
<p>काम विद्युत वितरण, प्रसारण, स्मार्ट मिटरिङ, नवीकरणीय ऊर्जा र युटिलिटी समन्वयसँग सम्बन्धित छ। नियुक्ति मुम्बई, गुरुग्राम र लद्दाखसहित भारतभरि हुनेछ र केही पद प्यान इन्डिया छन्। यो नियुक्ति पूर्ण रूपमा अस्थायी हो र यसले भविष्यमा RECPDCL मा नियमित रोजगारी दिँदैन।</p>
<h2>को आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2>
<p>भारतीय नागरिक मात्र आवेदन दिन सक्छन्। प्राविधिक पदका लागि इलेक्ट्रिकल, ईईई, ईसीई, सीएसई, आईटी वा सिभिल इन्जिनियरिङमा नियमित पूर्णकालीन बी.ई. वा बी.टेक, कम्तीमा ६०% अंक वा प्रथम श्रेणी चाहिन्छ। वित्त पदका लागि सीए, सीएमए वा वित्तमा एमबीए, ६०% अंक वा सो सरह सीजीपीए चाहिन्छ।</p>
<p>अनुभव १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ का आधारमा गणना गरिन्छ। वरिष्ठ कार्यकारीलाई १३ वर्ष, उप कार्यकारीलाई ६ वर्ष र सहायक कार्यकारीलाई ३ वर्षको सान्दर्भिक अनुभव चाहिन्छ। सोही मितिका आधारमा अधिकतम उमेर वरिष्ठ कार्यकारीका लागि ५५ वर्ष, उप कार्यकारीका लागि ४० वर्ष र सहायक कार्यकारीका लागि ३५ वर्ष छ।</p>
<h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2>
<p>२७ अक्टोबरदेखि १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ साँझ ६:३० बजेभित्र recpdcl.in मा अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्। उम्मेदवारले एउटा मात्र पदका लागि आवेदन दिनुपर्छ र फारम बुझाउनुअघि आधिकारिक विज्ञापन पढ्नुपर्छ। उमेर र अनुभवको कट-अफ मिति अन्तिम मिति नै भएकाले आफ्ना प्रमाणपत्रहरू तयार राख्नुहोस्।</p>
<h2>सूचनामा के छैन</h2>
<p>सूचनामा ३२ पदको कुल संख्या छापिएको छैन। ३२ भन्ने संख्या पदअनुसारको गणना — वरिष्ठ कार्यकारी ३, उप कार्यकारी १९ र सहायक कार्यकारी १० — को जोड हो, त्यसैले यसलाई गणना गरिएको कुल संख्या मान्नुपर्छ। सूचनामा कुनै आवेदन शुल्क उल्लेख छैन, त्यसैले यहाँ शुल्कको अंक दिइएको छैन। छनोट प्रक्रिया पनि हामीले हेरेका स्रोतहरूमा उल्लेख छैन, त्यसैले लिखित परीक्षा, अन्तर्वार्ता वा दुवै हुन्छ भन्ने पुष्टि भएको छैन। आवेदन दिनुअघि recpdcl.in मा विस्तृत विज्ञापन पढ्नुहोस्।</p>
<p>RECPDCL मा जागिर दिलाइदिन्छु भनेर कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। कुनै एजेन्ट वा बिचौलियाले तपाईंका लागि पद सुरक्षित गर्न सक्दैन र छनोटको बदलामा पैसा माग्ने जो कोहीलाई ठगी मान्नुपर्छ। आधिकारिक RECPDCL वेबसाइटबाट मात्र आवेदन दिनुहोस्।</p>
<p>यो पनि पढ्नुहोस्: <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/nlc-india-graduate-executive-trainee-143-posts-20261115">NLC इन्डिया ग्र्याजुएट एक्जिक्युटिभ ट्रेनी भर्ती २०२६ — GATE 2025 बाट १४३ पद</a>।</p>
<p>स्रोतहरू: RECPDCL विज्ञापन RECPDCL/HR/2026/03, <a href="https://www.sarkariresult.app/recpdcl-recruitment-2026-out-apply-online-32-senior-deputy-executive-posts/">Sarkari Result</a>, <a href="https://srn247.com/jobs/recpdcl-recruitment-2026-senior-executive-deputy-executive-assistant-executive-32-posts">SRN247</a>, <a href="https://advikpost.blog/2026/10/29/recpdcl-executive-recruitment-2026/">Advik Post</a> र <a href="https://theaspirantnews.com/job/recpdcl-senior-executive-deputy-executive-and-assistant-executive-32-posts-recruitment-2026-15374">The Aspirant News</a> बाट पढिएको, र आधिकारिक वेबसाइट <a href="https://www.recpdcl.in">recpdcl.in</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.sarkariresult.app/recpdcl-recruitment-2026-out-apply-online-32-senior-deputy-executive-posts/', 'https://srn247.com/jobs/recpdcl-recruitment-2026-senior-executive-deputy-executive-assistant-executive-32-posts', 'https://advikpost.blog/2026/10/29/recpdcl-executive-recruitment-2026/', 'https://theaspirantnews.com/job/recpdcl-senior-executive-deputy-executive-and-assistant-executive-32-posts-recruitment-2026-15374', 'https://www.recpdcl.in'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- fpsc-jobs-2026-278-posts-advertisement-4-20261116 (English 887 words; Nepali 582 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'fpsc-jobs-2026-278-posts-advertisement-4-20261116', 'global', 'Pakistan',
'FPSC Jobs 2026: 278 Federal Posts in Advertisement 4/2026, Apply by 23 November',
'FPSC जागिर २०२६: विज्ञापन ४/२०२६ मा २७८ संघीय पद, २३ नोभेम्बरसम्म आवेदन',
'The Federal Public Service Commission has announced 278 federal vacancies across 48 cases in Consolidated Advertisement 4/2026. The largest intake is 160 Assistant Audit Officers, and online applications close on 23 November 2026.',
'पाकिस्तानको संघीय लोक सेवा आयोगले समेकित विज्ञापन ४/२०२६ मा ४८ वटा मुद्दामा २७८ संघीय पदको घोषणा गरेको छ। सबैभन्दा ठूलो १६० सहायक लेखा परीक्षण अधिकारी पद हो र अनलाइन आवेदन २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म दिन सकिन्छ।',
$$<p>The Federal Public Service Commission (FPSC) of Pakistan has announced 278 federal government vacancies across 48 cases in Consolidated Advertisement 4/2026. The advertisement, dated 6 November 2026, covers posts from BS-16 to BS-20 in federal ministries, departments and the armed forces headquarters. The largest single intake is 160 Assistant Audit Officers (BS-17) in the Office of the Auditor General of Pakistan. Applications are online only at fpsc.gov.pk, and the last date is Monday 23 November 2026.</p>
<h2>At a glance</h2>
<table>
<tr><td>Commission</td><td>Federal Public Service Commission (FPSC), Pakistan</td></tr>
<tr><td>Advertisement</td><td>Consolidated Advertisement (Phase-4/2026), dated 6 November 2026, ref PID(I) 4263/26</td></tr>
<tr><td>Total vacancies</td><td>278 across 48 cases — a calculated sum, see the note below</td></tr>
<tr><td>Largest case</td><td>160 Assistant Audit Officer (BS-17), Office of the Auditor General of Pakistan</td></tr>
<tr><td>Scales</td><td>BS-16 to BS-20</td></tr>
<tr><td>Last date</td><td>Monday 23 November 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td>Test</td><td>MCQ screening test, tentatively from 2 January 2027</td></tr>
<tr><td>Fee</td><td>Rs 600 (BS-16/17), Rs 1,500 (BS-18), Rs 2,500 (BS-19), Rs 3,000 (BS-20 and above)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Apply at</td><td>fpsc.gov.pk</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>What is on offer</h2>
<p>The 48 cases cover a wide spread of federal work. Besides the 160 Assistant Audit Officer posts, there are 25 Demonstrator posts and a long list of professional openings — Professors, Associate Professors, Nurses, Research Officers, Assistant Directors, Engineers and Psychologists, among others. The posts sit in federal ministries, hospitals, engineering departments, Pakistan Railways and defence-related organisations, as well as in Gilgit-Baltistan.</p>
<p>Seats are divided by province and quota. For the Assistant Audit Officer posts alone, the allocation runs across Merit, Punjab, Sindh (Rural and Urban), Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Balochistan, Ex-FATA, Gilgit-Baltistan and Azad Jammu and Kashmir, with women and minorities quotas inside several of those shares. Candidates must check the quota and the eligibility rules for their own case in the advertisement itself.</p>
<h2>Who can apply</h2>
<p>Eligibility is set case by case, so there is no single qualification for the whole advertisement. For the largest post, Assistant Audit Officer (BS-17), case F.4-195/2026-R, candidates need a second class or Grade C Master degree in Business Administration (Finance or Accounting), Economics, Mathematics, Commerce or Statistics. A Master degree with an ICMA one-year postgraduate certificate, CA (Foundation) or ACCA (knowledge level) is also accepted, as is a Bachelor degree plus PIPFA or SAS qualification with three years of relevant service.</p>
<p>Other cases carry their own degree and experience rules, and the case numbers run from F.4-176/2026-R to F.4-222/2026-R, with the re-advertised case F.4-152/2026-R for Professors at PIMS. Read the original advertisement on fpsc.gov.pk before applying, because the advertisement prevails over any summary.</p>
<h2>How to apply</h2>
<p>Apply online only through the FPSC website, fpsc.gov.pk. Pay the fee before the closing date using the PSID generated by the FPSC online portal, through 1-Link — ATM, mobile banking, Easypaisa, JazzCash or over the counter. The fee depends on the scale of the post: Rs 600 for BS-16 and BS-17, Rs 1,500 for BS-18, Rs 2,500 for BS-19 and Rs 3,000 for BS-20 and above. No paper application is accepted.</p>
<h2>What the advertisement does not say</h2>
<p>The advertisement prints no combined total of vacancies. The figure of 278 is the sum of the vacancy counts printed for the 48 cases, so treat it as a calculated total rather than a figure printed in the advertisement itself. The advertisement also prints no salary figure, so no monthly pay is given in this article. The MCQ screening test is only tentatively planned from 2 January 2027 — the date is not confirmed, and the schedule and syllabus will be posted on fpsc.gov.pk.</p>
<p>Never pay anyone who promises you a federal job through FPSC. Selection runs only through the Commission, and no agent or middleman can secure a post for you. Anyone asking for money in exchange for selection should be treated as a scam. Apply only through the official FPSC website.</p>
<p>Read also: <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/psssb-junior-engineer-262-posts-20261116">PSSSB Junior Engineer recruitment 2026 — 262 posts, closing 17 November</a>.</p>
<p>Sources: FPSC Consolidated Advertisement (Phase-4/2026) dated 6 November 2026, read through <a href="https://neopakistani.com/en/government-jobs/fpsc-consolidated-advertisement-4-2026-278-posts-apply-by-23-november">NeoPakistani</a>, <a href="https://pakistanschemes.pk/fpsc-jobs-2026-consolidated-advertisement-4-2026/">Pakistan Schemes</a>, <a href="https://ixjob.pk/fpsc-jobs-2026/">ixjob.pk</a> and <a href="https://parhopak.com/fpsc-jobs-2026-consolidated-advertisement-4-2026/">Parho Pakistan</a>, and the official website <a href="https://www.fpsc.gov.pk">fpsc.gov.pk</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>पाकिस्तानको संघीय लोक सेवा आयोग (FPSC) ले समेकित विज्ञापन ४/२०२६ मा ४८ वटा मुद्दामा २७८ संघीय सरकारी पदको घोषणा गरेको छ। ६ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को विज्ञापनले संघीय मन्त्रालय, विभाग र सशस्त्र बल मुख्यालयका बीएस-१६ देखि बीएस-२० सम्मका पदहरू समेट्छ। सबैभन्दा ठूलो एकल भर्ती पाकिस्तानका महालेखा परीक्षकको कार्यालयमा १६० सहायक लेखा परीक्षण अधिकारी (बीएस-१७) पद हो। आवेदन fpsc.gov.pk मा अनलाइन मात्र दिन सकिन्छ र अन्तिम मिति सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ हो।</p>
<h2>एक नजरमा</h2>
<table>
