$$<p>CSIR-National Physical Laboratory (NPL), New Delhi, has invited offline applications for 25 Multi Tasking Staff (MTS) posts under Advertisement No. Rectt./05/2026. The laboratory is the National Metrology Institute of India, working under the Council of Scientific and Industrial Research (CSIR). The completed application form must reach NPL by post on or before 23 December 2026, and postal delay is not accepted as an excuse.</p>
<h2>At a glance</h2>
<table>
<tr><td>Organisation</td><td>CSIR-National Physical Laboratory, New Delhi</td></tr>
<tr><td>Advertisement</td><td>Rectt./05/2026, issued 13 November 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td>Total posts</td><td>25 — UR 12, EWS 3, OBC (NCL) 6, ST 4</td></tr>
<tr><td>Qualification</td><td>10th pass (12th desirable)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Age limit</td><td>18 to 25 years as on 23 December 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pay</td><td>Pay Level-1 (Rs 18,000 to 56,900); total emoluments about Rs 41,040 a month at the minimum in a Class X city, including HRA</td></tr>
<tr><td>Fee</td><td>Rs 500 by demand draft; nil for SC, ST, PwBD, women, transgender and abroad candidates</td></tr>
<tr><td>Last date</td><td>23 December 2026 (form must reach NPL)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Apply mode</td><td>Offline, by post only</td></tr>
<tr><td>Selection</td><td>OMR written examination, Class 10 standard</td></tr>
<tr><td>Official website</td><td>nplindia.in</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>What the job is</h2>
<p>The 25 posts are all Multi Tasking Staff, Post Code MTS, at the New Delhi laboratory. The advertisement does not describe the day-to-day duties in the summaries we checked, and the post is a support role inside a national research laboratory. What the advertisement does spell out is the process: there is no online form and no online payment anywhere in this recruitment, and every step runs on paper.</p>
<p>Selection is through an OMR written examination pitched at Class 10 standard. The vacancy numbers are provisional and may increase or decrease at the time of final selection, so the final count can shift from the advertised 25.</p>
<h2>Who can apply</h2>
<p>Indian citizens with a 10th pass — Matriculation or an equivalent qualification — can apply, and a 12th pass is listed as desirable. The age limit is 18 to 25 years as on 23 December 2026, the same date as the last date for receipt of the form. The reservation break-up is 12 posts for UR, 3 for EWS, 6 for OBC (NCL) and 4 for ST candidates.</p>
<h2>How to apply</h2>
<p>Download the prescribed application form from the official NPL website, nplindia.in. Complete it on paper and attach a crossed demand draft or pay order of Rs 500, drawn on a nationalised bank and valid for at least three months, in favour of "Director, National Physical Laboratory", payable at New Delhi. Write your name and the post on the back of the draft. SC, ST, PwBD, women, transgender and abroad candidates pay no fee.</p>
<p>Send the completed form by post in an envelope superscribed "APPLICATION FOR THE POST OF MTS" to the Senior Controller of Administration, CSIR-National Physical Laboratory, Dr K.S. Krishnan Marg, New Delhi-110012. The envelope must reach NPL on or before 23 December 2026, and the same date applies to candidates from far-flung areas. Applications arriving after the closing date for any reason, including postal delay, are not entertained. Fees once paid will not be refunded, and an application once submitted cannot be withdrawn.</p>
<h2>What the notification does not say</h2>
<p>The examination date is not stated in the notification, so no exam date is given here. The advertisement does not mention any online application route, and a fee sent any other way than the prescribed demand draft does not count. The vacancy numbers are provisional, as noted above, and the advertisement does not spell out the day-to-day duties of the post.</p>
<p>Never pay anyone who promises you a post at CSIR-NPL. The only fee in this recruitment is the Rs 500 demand draft sent with the form, and no agent or middleman can secure a post for you. Anyone asking for money in exchange for selection should be treated as a scam. Apply only through the prescribed form from nplindia.in.</p>
<p>Read also: <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/svsu-skill-instructor-45-posts-20261115">SVSU Skill Instructor recruitment 2026 — 45 regular posts, apply by 23 November</a>.</p>
<p>Sources: CSIR-NPL Advertisement No. Rectt./05/2026, read through <a href="https://www.freejobalert.com/articles/csir-npl-multi-tasking-staff-recruitment-2026-3081095">FreeJobAlert</a>, <a href="https://jobcareerupdates.in/blog/csir-npl-mts-recruitment-2026/">Job Career Updates</a> and <a href="https://offlinenaukri.com/csir-npl-mts-recruitment-2026/">Offline Naukri</a>, and the official website <a href="https://www.nplindia.in">nplindia.in</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>सीएसआईआर-राष्ट्रिय भौतिक प्रयोगशाला (NPL), नयाँ दिल्लीले विज्ञापन नम्बर Rectt./05/2026 अन्तर्गत २५ मल्टि टास्किङ स्टाफ (MTS) पदका लागि अफलाइन आवेदन मागेको छ। यो प्रयोगशाला भारतको राष्ट्रिय मापन विज्ञान संस्थान हो र वैज्ञानिक तथा औद्योगिक अनुसन्धान परिषद् (CSIR) अन्तर्गत काम गर्छ। पूरा आवेदन फारम २३ डिसेम्बर २०२६ सम्ममा हुलाकबाट NPL मा पुग्नुपर्छ र ढिलो हुलाकलाई बहाना मानिँदैन।</p>
<h2>एक नजरमा</h2>
<table>
<tr><td>संस्था</td><td>सीएसआईआर-राष्ट्रिय भौतिक प्रयोगशाला, नयाँ दिल्ली</td></tr>
<tr><td>विज्ञापन</td><td>Rectt./05/2026, जारी मिति १३ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr>
<tr><td>कुल पद</td><td>२५ — सामान्य १२, ईडब्ल्यूएस ३, ओबीसी (एनसीएल) ६, एसटी ४</td></tr>
